t to default, at least not until you close the scene and reopen it.\n\nVideo: https://youtu.be/8mUIYUwNNLM\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAdd a child scene to your main scene, right click on the node, select Editable Children to enable it, change visibility of one ofthe editable children, then right click the the node again and disable Editable Children. Observe the scene remained in the same state and did not reset to default as it should. Now save the scene, close and open it again and observe the node is now properly reset to its default state.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[EditableChildrenMrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19504432/EditableChildrenMrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104718/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104718/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}